sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant AuthController
    participant PasswordResetService
    participant Mailer
    participant Database

    User->>AuthController: POST /forgot-password (email)
    AuthController->>PasswordResetService: sendResetLink(email)
    PasswordResetService->>Database: SELECT user WHERE email = ?

    alt Email not found
        PasswordResetService-->>AuthController: silent return
    else Email found
        PasswordResetService->>Database: UPDATE users SET reset_token, expires_at
        PasswordResetService->>Mailer: send reset link email
        Mailer-->>User: Email with reset link
    end
    AuthController-->>User: Redirect /forgot-password/sent

    Note over User: User clicks link in email

    User->>AuthController: GET /reset-password?token=...
    AuthController->>Database: SELECT user WHERE token = hash AND not expired

    alt Token invalid / expired
        AuthController-->>User: Show error, redirect to forgot-password
    else Token valid
        AuthController-->>User: Show reset password form
        User->>AuthController: POST /reset-password (new password)
        AuthController->>PasswordResetService: resetPassword(token, newPassword)
        PasswordResetService->>Database: UPDATE users SET password_hash, clear token
        AuthController-->>User: Redirect /login with success
    end
